OL,3,GNEWSAMillionaire who abused women in
OL,4,AHighland home loses travel ban appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FBooth appealed the judgement, but the
OL,7,FSheriff Appeal Court refused the appeal
OL,8,Fon all grounds.
